      "word_count": 76,
      "title": "John Murtagh General Practice",
      "author": "John",
      "year": "2020",
      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Patient education resources\nIndicates where you can find relevant information from Murtagh’s Patient Education,\neighth edition, to photocopy and hand out to patients.\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
