    "text": "10\n11\n12\nFraser RC. Clinical Method: A General Practice Approach (3rd edn). Oxford:\nButterworth-Heinemann, 1999: 6–72.\nScott AM, Del Mar C. Controlling antibiotic prescribing for lower respiratory tract\ninfections. BMJ, 2017; 357: j2398.\nTam M. Hints and tips in the medical consultation: The Medicine Box: Advice March\n2007: 1–3.\n",
