    "text": "18\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\ndisclosure of diagnosis inevitable? Dev Med Child Neurol, 1984; 26: 33–9.\nWilliams CD. Overcoming Depression and Low Mood: A Five Areas Approach (3rd edn).\nLondon: Hodder Education, 2009.\nDe Vaul RA, Zisook S, Stuart HJ. Patients with psychogenic pain. J Fam Pract, 1977; 4(1):\n53–5.\nLesieur HR, Blume S. The South Oaks Gambling Screen (SOGS): a new instrument for\nthe identification of pathological gamblers. Am J Psychiatry, 1987; 144: 1184–8.\nBlaszczynski A. How to treat: problem gambling. Australian Doctor, 2005; 12 August:\n37–44.\nMurtagh JE. Patient Education (7th edn). Sydney: McGraw-Hill, 2017: 2.\nBader E. Working with families. Aust Fam Physician, 1990; 19: 522–8.\n",
