  {
    "text": "Page 76\nFIGURE 9.3  Hypothyroidism in a 60-year-old woman, a classic masquerade,\nwith a slow subtle onset of facial changes\nA century ago it was important to consider diseases such as syphilis and tuberculosis as\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 220,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
