    "text": " 6\n 7\n 8\n 9\n10\n2001; 30(7): 636–40.\nLevenstein JH et al. The patient-centred method. I. A model for the doctor–patient\ninteraction in family medicine. Fam Pract, 1986; 3: 24–30.\nMain CJ, Williams AC. ABC of psychological medicine. BMJ, 2002 (Sept 7); 325: 534–7.\nMcAvoy BR, Murtagh J. Workplace bullying: the silent epidemic. Editorial. BMJ, 2003;\n326: 776–7.\nBorland R et al. Illnesses that Australians fear most in 1986 and 1993. Australian Journal\nof Public Health, 1994; 18: 366–9.\nHalitosis in oral and dental [published 2018 Dec]. In: Therapeutic Guidelines [digital].\nMelbourne: Therapeutic Guidelines Limited; 2018 Dec. www.tg.org.au, accessed\nDecember 2019.\n",
