  {
    "text": "Table 11.4\nFIGURE 11.4  Blood glucose control guidelines for diabetes management\nSuggested guidelines for glycaemic control (blood\nglucose mmol/L)4,5,19\nIdeal\nSuboptimal or unacceptable\nBefore meals (fasting)\n<5.5\n>7.7\nAfter meals (2 hours postprandial)\n<7\n>11 \nHbA1c %*\n≤7\n>8  \n",
