    "text": "Table 14.2\nFIGURE 14.2  Clinical features of hypothyroidism\nOther diverse presentations of thyroid disorders are given in TABLE 14.2\n.\nVarious diverse presentations of thyroid disorders3,5\nHypothyroidism\nHyperthyroidism\n",
