    "text": "10\n11\n12\n13\n14\n15\nDavey P. Medicine at a Glance (3rd edn). Oxford: Blackwell Publishing, 2010: 36–7.\nMoreau P et al. Frontline therapy of multiple myeloma. Blood, 14 May 2015; 125(20):\n3076–84. [PMID 25838345]\nOza A et al. Waldenstrom macroglobinemia: prognosis and management. Blood Cancer J,\n2015; March 27(5): e394.\nAustralian Institute of Health and Welfare 2017. Cancer in Australia 2017. Cancer series\nno.101. Cat. no. CAN 100. Canberra: AIHW, 2017: 72.\nGiles G. Cancer Survival in Victoria. Melbourne: Cancer Council Victoria, 2009.\nDavey P. Medicine at a Glance (3rd edn). Oxford: Blackwell Publishing, 2010: 380.\n",
