    }
  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 19.1  Classic erythema nodosum involving the legs of a patient with\npulmonary tuberculosis\nProgressive primary tuberculosis\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 466,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
