  {
    "text": "FIGURE 19.2  Natural history of TB infection\n*TST = tuberculin skin test\n**IGRA = interferon gamma release assay\nSource: Based on WHO algorithm and Dr Grant Jenkin (personal communication)\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 468,
