    "text": " 9\n10\n11\n12\n13\nBeers MD et al. The Merck Manual (18th edn). Whitehouse Station: Merck Research\nLaboratories, 2006: 1850–1.\nBeers MD et al. The Merck Manual (18th edn). Whitehouse Station: Merck Research\nLaboratories, 2006: 1914–5.\nBeers MD et al. The Merck Manual (18th edn). Whitehouse Station: Merck Research\nLaboratories, 2006: 1853.\nBahra A, Cikurel K. Neurology. London: Mosby, 1999: 204–5.\nLongmore M et al. Oxford Handbook of Clinical Medicine. Oxford: Oxford University\nPress, 2007: 420.\n",
