      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Page 212\nPainful restriction of movement of shoulders and hips (other joints not usually involved)\nSigns may be absent later in day\nESR typically >40 but may be normal\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 526,
