      "year": "2020",
      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Page 281\nFIGURE 25.1  Physical examination: possible findings to consider in diagnosis\nThe specific inflamed joint or joints may give an indication of the disease process. Typical joints\naffected by various arthropathies are illustrated in FIGURE 25.2\n.\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 687,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
