    "text": "Normal joint\n\nRheumatoid\narthritis\n\ncysts\n\njoint destruction\nsubluxation\n\nerosion joint margins\nosteoporosis\nosteopenia\n\nloss of joint ———_»\nspace\nsoft tissue we\n\nswelling\n\nOsteoarthritis\n\nperiarticular\nbone\nsclerosis\n\nmarginal osteophytes\n\nloss of joint space\n\ncysts\n\nGout\n\nnermal joint\npunched out space\nperlarticular cyst\nerosions\n\nsoft tissue\nswelling\n",
