    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Page 333\nFIGURE 28.9  Lumbar spondylosis with degeneration of the disc and facet\njoint, leading to narrowing of the spinal canal and intervertebral foramen (spinal\ncanal stenosis)\nManagement\n",
