    "text": " 5\n 6\n 7\n 8\n 9\n10\n11\nBarton S, ed. Clinical Evidence. London: BMJ Publishing Group, 2001: 231–5.\nFunctional gastrointestinal disorders [published 2016]. In: Therapeutic Guidelines\n[digital]. Melbourne: Therapeutic Guidelines Limited; 2016. www.tg.org.au, accessed\nSeptember 2017.\nTabber MM et al. Evaluation and treatment of functional constipation in infants and\nchildren: evidence-based recommendations from ESPGHAN and NASPGHAN. J\nPaediatric Gastroenterial Nutrition, 2014; 58(2): 258–70.\nGuree A, Rimer R, Marks M. In: Paediatric Handbook (9th edn). Oxford: Wiley\nBlackwell, 2015: 98–101.\nCancer Australia. Bowel cancer (colorectal cancer) in Australia statisitics [20 October\n2020]. Bowel cancer. Australian Government. Available from:\nhttps://www.canceraustralia.gov.au/affected-cancer/cancer-types/bowel-cancer/bowel-\ncancer-colorectal-cancer-australia-statistics, accessed March 2021.\nAvery Jones F, Godding FW. Management of Constipation. Oxford: Blackwell Scientific\nPublications, 1972: 16.\nRoyal Australian College of General Practitioners. Guidelines for preventive activities in\ngeneral practice (9th edn). East Melbourne, VIC: RACGP, 2016.\n",
