    }
  },
  {
    "text": "asthma\nleft ventricular failure\npostnasal drip\nchronic bronchitis\nwhooping cough\nWaking cough →\nbronchiectasis, asthma\nchronic bronchitis\nGORD\nhabitual\nAssociations\nChanging posture →\nbronchiectasis\nlung abscess\nMeals →\nhiatus hernia (possible)\noesophageal diverticulum\ntracheo-oesophageal fistula\nWheezing →\nasthma\nBreathlessness →\nasthma\nleft ventricular failure\nCOPD\nSputum\n",
