  {
    "text": "11\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\nBrandt T, Daroff DB. Physical therapy for BPPV. Arch Otolaryngol, 1980; 106: 484–5.\nKuo CH, Pang L, Chang R. Vertigo—part 1—assessment in general practice. Aust Fam\nPhysician, 2008; 37(5): 341–7.\nFroehling IA et al. The canalith repositioning procedure for BPPV: a randomised\ncontrolled trial. Mayo Clin Proc, 2000; 75: 695–700.\nTonkin JP. Meniere’s disease. Current Therapeutics, 1995; 36: 39–43.\nPohl D. Vertigo. In: MIMS Disease Index (2nd edn). Sydney: IMS Publishing, 1996: 568–\n71.\nMatthews T. Peripheral vertigo in general practice. Cont Med Education, 2006; 33: 267–\n70.\nYaseen K et al. The effectiveness of manual therapy in treating cervicogenic dizziness: a\nsystematic review. J Phys Ther Sci, 2018; 30(1): 96–102.\n",
