    "text": " 1\n 2\n 3\n 4\n 5\n 6\n 7\n 8\n 9\nReferences\nKuo P, Holloway R. Dysphagia: how to treat. Australian Doctor, 8 February 2013: 21–8.\nTrate DM, Parkman HP, Fisher RS. Dysphagia: evaluation, diagnosis and treatment.\nPrimary Care, 1996; 23: 417–32.\nBreen K. A practical approach to patients with dysphagia or pain on swallowing. Modern\nMedicine Australia, 1992; 3: 50–6.\nAbeygunasekera S. Difficult and painful swallowing: a guide for GPs. Medicine Today,\n2003; 4(10): 33–40.\nRoman S, Kahrilas PJ. Management of spastic disorders of the esophagus. Gastroenterol\nClin North Am, 2013; 42(1): 27–43.\nDisorders of the oesophagus [published 2016]. In: Therapeutic Guidelines [digital].\nMelbourne: Therapeutic Guidelines Limited; 2016. www.tg.org.au, accessed October\n2019.\nPorter RS, Kaplan JL, eds. The Merck Manual (19th edn). NJ: Merck, Sharp & Dohme\nCorp, 2011: 78.\nKakakios A, Heine R. Eosinophilic oesophagitis. Med J Aust, 2006; 185(7): 401.\nThomson K, Tey D, Marks M. Paediatric Handbook (8th edn). Oxford: Wiley-Blackwell,\n2009: 232.\n",
