    "text": "* erythema of\nprominent blood vessels\nprogressing down\nhandle of malleus\n\n* normal drum\n\n* progressive\nenthema\n* Joss of light reflex\n\n®* bulging pars flaccida\n\n® red pars tensa\n\n®* anatomical structures\nunidentifiable\n",
