  },
  {
    "text": "39\n\n38\n37\n1 2#& @ 4 6 & F 8 8 10 11 T2 T3 14 15 16 TT? “18 19: 20 21\nPeriodic relapsing fever: quartan fever of malaria (a 4-day pattern with fever peaks every third day)\n39\n38\na7\n1 #2 32 4 5 6&6 Ff 8 8 10 11 12 13 #14 15 16 47 18 19 20° 21\nUndulant fever: due to lymphoma\n39\n38\n27\n12 3 4 5 6&6 7 8&8 8 160 11 12 13 44\nContinuous pattern\n39\n338\na7\n\na |\n1 2 2 4 5 & FF 82 8 10 171 12 7 14 15 16 17 18 12 20: 4\n\nQuotidian fever pattern and intermittent fever\n(e.g. empyema of gall bladder)\n",
