    "text": "20\n21\n22\n23\n24\nAhmed R, Apen K, Endean C. Epilepsy in pregnancy. Aust Fam Physician, 2014; 43(3):\n112–6.\nSofou K et al. Management of prolonged seizures and status epilepticus in childhood: a\nsystematic review. J Child Neurol, 2009; 24(8): 918–26.\nCaplan LR. Transient global amnesia: criteria and classification. Neurology, 1986; 36:\n441.\nHorne M. Neurology quiz. Aust Fam Physician, 1994; 23: 935.\nThieben MJ et al. Postural orthostatic tachycardia syndrome: the Mayo Clinic experience.\nMayo Clin Proc, March 2007; 82(3): 308–13.\n",
