    "text": " 1\n 2\n 3\n 4\n 5\n 6\n 7\nReferences\nCarroll RL. Hoarseness. In: MIMS Disease Index (2nd edn). Sydney: IMS Publishing,\n1996: 239–40.\nBova R, McGuinness J. Hoarseness: a guide to voice disorders. Medicine Today, 2007;\n8(2): 38–44.\nPriestly J, Havas TE. Benign vocal fold lesions. Medical Observer, 19 November 2012: 1–\n3.\nCooper L, Quested RA. Hoarseness: an approach for the general practitioner. Aust Fam\nPhysician, 2016; 45(6): 378–81.\nBirman C, Fitzsimons, Quayle S. Little voices: therapy update. Australian Doctor, 7 May\n2004: 49–50.\nIdrees M et al. Vocal cord dysfunction in bronchial asthma. A review article. J Asthma,\n2015; 52(4): 327–35.\nMurgu S, Colt H. Tracheobronchomalacia and excessive dynamic airway collapse. Clin\nChest Med, 2013; 34(3): 527–55.\n",
