    "text": " 5\n 6\n 7\n 8\nHughes C, O’Brien C. Neck lumps: how to treat. Australian Doctor, 5 August 2005: 31–8.\nLarkins R, Smallwood R. Clinical Skills. Melbourne: Melbourne University Press, 1993:\n133–4.\nHobbs C, Bova R. Neck lumps: a guide to assessment and management. Medicine Today,\n2010; 11(4): 26–34.\nGwee A, Rimer R, Marks M. Paediatric Handbook (9th edn). Melbourne: Wiley-\nBlackwell, 2015: 291.\n",
    "metadata": {
