    "text": "12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n18\n11\nJ, 2013; 95-B(9):1158–64.\nSmidt N et al. Corticosteroid injections, physiotherapy or a wait and see policy for lateral\nepicondylitis: a randomised controlled trial. Lancet, 2002; 359: 657–62.\nKleopa RA. Carpal tunnel syndrome. Ann Internal Medicine, 2015; 163(5): ITCI.\nSkin and soft tissue infections [published 2019]. In: Therapeutic Guidelines [digital].\nMelbourne: Therapeutic Guidelines Limited; 2019. www.tg.org.au, accessed October\n2017.\nIreland D. The hand (part one). Aust Fam Physician, 1986; 15: 1162–71.\nBrukner P, Khan K. Brukner & Khan’s Clinical Sports Medicine (4th edn). Sydney:\nMcGraw-Hill, 2012: 429.\nSheon R, Moskowitz R, Goldberg V. Soft Tissue Rheumatic Pain. Philadelphia: Lea &\nFebiger, 1987: 134–40.\nMyers S, Della Torre P. Hand and wrist disorders (part 2): how to treat. Australian Doctor,\n11 March 2011: 32–4.\n",
