      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 55.5  Common sites of acute arterial occlusion\nSigns and symptoms—the 6 Ps\nPain\nPallor\nParaesthesia or numbness\nPulselessness\nParalysis\n‘Perishing’ cold\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 1592,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 160,
