    "text": "13\n14\nclinical trial of high-dose supplementation with vitamins C and E, beta-carotene, and zinc\nfor age-related macular degeneration and vision loss. Arch Ophthalmol, 2001; 119: 1417–\n36.\nSingh A et al. Visual manifestations in giant cell arteritis: trend over 5 decades in a\npopulation-based cohort. J Rheumatol, 2015; 42(2): 309–15.\nGonzalez-Gay MA et al. Giant cell arteritis and polymyalgia rheumatica: an update. Curr\nRheumatol Rep, 2015 Sept; 17(2): 6.\n",
