  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 72.1  Acute urticaria in a child caused by a sensitivity to aspirin\nFeeling of intense fear (angor animi)\nAngioedema of face and airway\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 2030,
      "chunk_index": 0,
