    }
  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 84.3  Example of growth chart with FTT from inadequate calorie\nintake (the red dots indicate FTT). Note how the weight drop is more marked\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 2261,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 146,
