      "year": "2020",
      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 84.5  Growing pains: typical sites of pain\nEpisodic, with pain-free intervals from weeks to months\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 2267,
      "type": "drug_info",
      "char_count": 106,
