    "text": "18\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\nNSW Ministry of Health: NSW health policy statements for children and infants.\nBronchiolitis—acute management, October 2012. Available from:\nwww.health.NSW.gov.au/policies/, accessed 25 November 2017; reviewed 19 January\n2017.\nTurner T et al. Evidence based guideline for the management of bronchiolitis. Aust Fam\nPhysician, Special issue, 2008; 37(6): 6–13.\nNSW Ministry of Health: NSW health policy statements for children and infants. Asthma\n—acute management, October 2012. Available from: www.health.NSW.gov.au/policies/,\naccessed 25 November 2017.\nPitt R. Common paediatric emergencies. Aust Fam Physician, 1989; 18: 1228–34.\nNSW Ministry of Health: NSW health policy statements for children and infants. Seizures\n—acute management, October 2009. Available from: www.health.NSW.gov.au/policies/,\naccessed December 2014.\nNSW Ministry of Health: NSW health policy statements for children and infants.\nGastroenteritis—acute management, February 2010. Available from:\nwww.health.NSW.gov.au/policies/, accessed September 2014.\n",
