  {
    "text": " 8\n 9\n10\n11\n12\n13\n14\nPage 1064\nWesthoff C et al. Quick start: a novel oral contraceptive initiation method. \nContraception, 2002; 66: 141–8.\nMoore P. Recent developments in contraception: how to treat. Australian Doctor, 3 April \n2009: 25–32.\nEdelman AB et al. Continuous or extended cycle vs. cyclic use of combined oral \ncontraceptives for contraception. Cochrane Database Syst Rev, 2005; Issue 3: Article No. \nCD004695.\nBillings E, Westmore A. The Billings Method. Melbourne: Anne O’Donovan, 1992: 11–\n49.\nBateson D et al. Contraception for women aged over 40. Medicine Today, 2012; 13(8): \n27–36.\nWoolcott R. Vasectomy reversal: how to treat. Australian Doctor, 4 July 2014: 19–26.\nMazza D et al. Medical Abortion. AJGP, June 2020; 49(6): 324-30.  \n",
