      "word_count": 161,
      "title": "John Murtagh General Practice",
      "author": "John",
      "year": "2020",
      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Table 93.3\nFIGURE 93.4  Important ‘tell-tale’ symptoms of breast cancer\nNipple discharge15\nThe diagnostic strategy is outlined in TABLE 93.3\n.\nNipple discharge: diagnostic strategy model\nProbability diagnosis\nPhysiological\nPregnancy\nIntraduct papilloma\nLactation/lactation cysts\nMammary dysplasia\nSerious disorders not to be missed\nInfection:\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 2507,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 343,
      "word_count": 43,
      "title": "John Murtagh General Practice",
