  },
  {
    "text": "Move the hand in slow circular movements.\nExamine up and down the breast in vertical strips beginning from the axillary tail (see\nFIG. 93.7\n).\nFIGURE 93.7  Systematic examination of the breast\nSystematically cover the six areas of the breast (see FIG. 93.8\n):\nthe four quadrants\nthe axillary tail\nthe region deep to the nipple and areola\n",
