  {
    "text": "Page 1073\nFIGURE 93.8  The six areas of the breast\n4. If a suspicious lump is present, inspect liver, lungs and spine.\nNote:\nMost cancers occur in the upper outer quadrant (see FIG. 93.9\n).15\nA useful diagram to record the findings is shown in FIGURE 93.10\n.\n",
