  {
    "text": "FIGURE 93.9  Relative frequencies of breast cancer at various anatomical\nsegments\nFIGURE 93.10  Diagrammatic scheme for recording the features of breast\nlumps and any lymphadenopathy (axilla and supraclavicular triangles)\n",
    "metadata": {
