    "text": "12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n18\nYeoh M. Investigation and management of an ovarian mass. Aust Fam Physician, Jan/Feb\n2015; (44)1: 48–52.\nEndometriosis. [published 2020]. In: Therapeutic Guidelines [digital]. Melbourne:\nTherapeutic Guidelines Limited; 2020. www.tg.org.au, accessed May 2021.\nAbbott J. A pragmatic approach to surgical management of endometriosis. O&G\nMagazine, 2019; 21(2).\nJohnson NP, Hummelshoj L, The World Endometriosis Society Montpellier Consortium.\nConsensus on current management of endometriosis. Hum Reprod, 2013; 28(6): 1552–68.\nSaha S. What else could it be? Causes of pelvic pain. O&G Magazine, 2019; 21(2).\nStone K. Scope of medical imaging for pelvic pain. O&G Magazine, 2019; 21(2).\nWomen’s Health & Research Institute of Australia. Pudendal neuralgia. Available from:\nwww.whria.com.au/for-patients/pelvic-pain/pudendal-neuralgia/, accessed May 2021.\n",
