  },
  {
    "text": "Table 98.4\nPage 1117\nFIGURE 98.1  Wet film method\nWet film examination\nLactobacilli Polymorphs\nEpithelial\ncells\nClue\ncells\nOther\nNormal\n+\nNone or\noccasional\n+\n−\nCandidiasis\n+\nNone or\noccasional\n+\n−\nSpores/hyphae\nTrichomoniasis\nAbsent\nor scant\nNumerous\n+\n−\nTrichomonads\nBacterial\nvaginosis\nAbsent\nor scant\nNumerous\n+\n2–\n50%\nSource: Reproduced with permission from Weisberg E. Wet film examination. Aust Fam Physician, 1991; 20: 291–4.\nRefer to FIGURE 98.2\n.\n",
