      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Vulval fissures\nVulvovaginal erythema (brick red)\nVaginal excoriation and oedema\nWhite, curd-like discharge (see FIG. 98.3\n)\nSuperficial dyspareunia\nDysuria\n",
