  {
    "text": "FIGURE 99.1  Lichen sclerosus et atrophicus in a 55-year-old woman. This\nshows white sclerotic plaques and epidermal atrophy.\nDxT genital pruritus + soreness + white wrinkled plaques → lichen\nsclerosus\nClinical features\nBimodal peak: prepubertal girls, perimenopause\nMean age of onset in adult women is 50 years\nPruritus is main symptom\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 2634,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
