    "text": "FIGURE 106.1  Diagrammatic comparison of bladder outlet obstruction\nDxT poor urine flow + straining to void + frequency → BOO\nClinical features of benign prostatic obstruction\nHesitancy\nFrequency of micturition\nUrgency\n",
