  {
    "text": "10\n11\n12\n13\n14\n15\nHunter T. Investigating fertility. O&G Magazine, Spring 2014; 6(3). Available from: \nwww.ogmagazine.org.au/16/3-16/investigating-fertility, accessed April 2021.\nThe Jean Hailes Foundation for Women’s Health. PCOS. Available from: \nhttps://jeanhailes.org.au/health-a-z/pcos, accessed April 2021.\nFamily Planning NSW. Reproductive and Sexual Health: An Australian Clinical Practice \nHandbook (3rd edn). Sydney: Family Planning NSW, 2016.\nMonash University. PCOS GP Tool, 2018. Available from: \nwww.monash.edu/__data/assets/pdf_file/0010/1459243/pcos-gp-tool.pdf, accessed April \n2021. \nCraig S. A medical model for infertility counselling. Aust Fam Physician, 1990; 19: 491–\n500.\nDyer S et al. International Committee for Monitoring Assisted Reproductive Technologies \nworld report: assisted reproductive technology 2008, 2009 and 2010. Hum Reprod, 2016; \n31: 1588–1609.\n",
