    "text": "Page 1231\nFolliculitis\nFlexures\nAtopic dermatitis\nPsoriasis\nSeborrhoeic dermatitis\nTinea\nCandida\nPediculosis\nMouth\nAphthous ulcers\nHerpes simplex\nCandida\nMeasles\nNails\nPsoriasis\nTinea\nDermatitis\nPenis\nScabies\nGenital herpes and warts\nCandida\nPsoriasis\n",
