      "word_count": 195,
      "title": "John Murtagh General Practice",
      "author": "John",
      "year": "2020",
      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "snip off with scissors or bone forceps (see FIG. 116.1\n)\nor\ntie base with fine cotton or suture material\nor\ndiathermy or electrocautery of base\nor\napply liquid nitrogen (see FIG. 116.2\n)\nFIGURE 116.1  Removal of skin tag using bone forceps\n",
