      "edition": "8th"
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "FIGURE 116.3  (a) Configuration of a sebaceous cyst; (b), (c) standard\ndissection of a large sebaceous cyst\nManagement\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 3033,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
