  {
    "text": "FIGURE 119.6  Beau lines in nails following an episode of acute cholecystitis\na few months earlier\nFIGURE 119.7  Habit tic: horizontal grooves on thumb nails\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "John Murtagh General Practice, 8th Edition.pdf",
      "page": 3130,
      "chunk_index": 0,
