    "text": "Page 1331\nHorizontal single white lines or band\nCauses\nChemotherapy\nArsenic poisoning\nKidney failure\nLamellar splitting (onychoschizia)\nSee FIGURE 119.8\n.\nFIGURE 119.8  Lamellar splitting\nCauses\nTrauma—repeated wetting and drying (e.g. housework)\nAge-related\nAbnormal curvature\nCauses\nSpoon nails: koilonychia\nSee FIGURE 119.9\n.\nIdiopathic (most cases, esp. children)\nHereditary\nTrauma\nIron deficiency\n",
