    "text": "winter blues see seasonal affective disorder (SAD)\nwinter depression see seasonal affective disorder (SAD)\nwinter itch 1242\n–3\n, 1243\nwisdom teeth\near pain 469\nfacial pain 501\nWolff–Parkinson–White syndrome\npalpitations 722\nsupraventricular tachycardia 730\nwomen’s business 1440\n–1\nwomen’s health see breast cancer; breast lumps; cervical cancer; contraception; menopause;\nosteoporosis; pregnancy; vaginal discharge\nWomen’s Health Initiative study 1108\nwood pulp worker’s disorder 464\nWood’s light 1230\n, 1230\nWorld Anti-Doping Agency 123\n, 123\nWorld Health Organization 4\n, 47\n, 57\n, 1431\n, 1460\nWorld Health Organization–International Society of Hypertension 902\nWorld Medical Association 1354\nWorld Organization of National Colleges and Assemblies of General Practice 57\nworm infestations\nIndigenous Australians 1445\nworms 1473\n–6\nwound dressings 1434\nskin ulcers 1285\nwound management\nskin ulcers 1284\n, 1287\nwounds\nanaesthesia for children 1381\nwrist injuries 1401\n–2\n, 1401\n–2\nwriter’s cramp 229\nX\nX-rays\narthritis 282\navulsion bony injuries 652\nbreast lumps 1074\nchest pain 355\n",
    "metadata": {
