  {
    "text": "Page 1567\nxerosis\npruritus 1237\nxerostomia 755\n, 755\nXiaflex 636\nY\nyellow fever 168\n, 566\n, 1459\n, 1460\nyellow flags\ndiagnosis 78\n, 78\nlower back pain 324\nYerkes–Dodson curve 841\nYersinia 411\n, 416\n, 422\nYersinia entero-colitica 1465\nZ\nZ scores\nosteoporosis 938\n–9\n, 938\nzanamivir\ninfluenza 392\nzidovudine 178\nneedle-stick and sharps injuries 1386\nzinc 41\ntinnitus 408\nzinc deficiency\nhair disorders 1317\n, 1318\nnappy rash 1257\nzinc lozenges\ncommon cold 391\nzinc oxide\nnappy rash 1257\nzinc pyrithione\ndandruff 1326\nzinc sulphate\ndacryocystitis 493\nziprasidone\nschizophrenia 834\nZipzoc 1285\nZollinger–Ellison syndrome\n",
