    }
  },
  {
    "text": "83\nConvulsions\nSection A\n!\n• Metabolic causes of convulsions must be excluded \nimmediately. Brain imaging is indicated if the cause \nis not easily identified as delay in treatment may \nresult in a poor prognosis.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Churchills_Pocketbook_of_Differential_Diagnosis (1).pdf",
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 237,
