  {
    "text": "235\nIMPOTENCE\nSection A\n■\n■\nUrinary cortisol assay\nCushing’s syndrome.\n■\n■\nPlasma cortisol\nCushing’s syndrome.\n!\n• Loss of libido may be an early manifestation of \nsignificant depressive illness. Thorough investigation \nfor possible organic or psychogenic disease is \nnecessary.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Churchills_Pocketbook_of_Differential_Diagnosis (1).pdf",
      "page": 248,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 303,
