  {
    "text": "281\nJOINT DISORDERS\nSection A\n!\n• Septic arthritis is an emergency. Immediate \nassessment and management is required in order to \navert long-term joint damage.\n• New onset inflammatory arthritis dictates rapid \nreferral to a specialist, as early intensive intervention \nhas been shown to markedly improve prognosis.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Churchills_Pocketbook_of_Differential_Diagnosis (1).pdf",
      "page": 294,
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "char_count": 340,
