    "text": "450\nTongue Disorders\n■\n■\nHIV test\nHairy leucoplakia.\n■\n■\nCT/MRI\nPituitary tumour in acromegaly.\n■\n■\nOral glucose tolerance test with growth hormone and IGF-1 \nmeasurement\nAcromegaly.\n■\n■\nACTH stimulation tests\nAddison’s disease.\n■\n■\nBiopsy\nCarcinoma.\n!\n• A mouth ulcer which does not settle requires further \ninvestigation for malignancy especially in smokers.\n• Candidal infection may be the first manifestation of \ndiabetes or an immunosuppressive disease, e.g. HIV \ninfection.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
