    }
  },
  {
    "text": "457\nUrethral Discharge\nSection A\n!\n• Always take a full sexual history, including unusual \nsexual practices and, if STD is suspected, refer to a \nGUM clinic for full assessment and contact tracing.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
