    "text": "487\nWeight Loss\nSection A\n!\n• Dramatic weight loss over a short period of \ntime raises the possibility of malignancy. Urgent \ninvestigation is mandatory.\n■\n■\nEchocardiography\nVentricular impairment with cardiac failure.\n■\n■\nStool cultures\nMicroscopy for helminths and their ova. Helminths may \noccasionally be visible with the naked eye.\nHIV antibodies\n■\n■\nFor the diagnosis of HIV.\nSUBASH KC/NMC-15TH/2014\n",
