    "text": "YOUR ULTIMATE GUIDE TO SURVIVAL IN THE ED!\n\nOXFORD HANDBOOK OF\nEMERGENCY\nMEDICINE\n\nJonathan P Wyatt | Robert G. Taylor\nKerstin de Wit | Emily J. Horton\n\nThe maest-have handbook for all those invalved in\noMmergency medicine\n\nCevers all che conditions that commenly present to the\nEmergency Department\n\nUpdated with the latest treatment guidelines\n\nPacked with a host of new X-rays to aid identificanion\n\nand treaiment\n\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "OXFORD HANDBOOK OF EMERGENCY MEDICINE 5TH EDITION (2020).pdf",
      "page": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "char_count": 418,
