    "text": "  \nIn-hospital resuscitation algorithm\n49\nIn-​hospital resuscitation algorithm\nNO\nCall resuscitation team\nApply pads/monitor\nAttempt deﬁbrillation\nif appropriate\nAdvanced Life Support\nwhen resuscitation\nteam arrives\nCPR 30:2\nWith oxygen and airway\nadjuncts\nYES\nAssess ABCDE\nRecognize and treat\nOxygen, monitoring, IV access\nCall resuscitation team\nif appropriate\nHand over to\nresuscitation team\nCollapsed/sick patient\nShout for HELP and assess\npatient\nSigns of life?\nFig. 2.3  In-​hospital resuscitation algorithm.\nReproduced with the kind permission of the Resuscitation Council (UK), M www.resus.org.uk\n \n",
