    "text": "54\n54\nChapter 2  Life-threatening emergencies\nAdvanced Life Support algorithm\nFig. 2.6  Advanced Life Support algorithm.\nReproduced with the kind permission of the Resuscitation Council (UK), M www.resus.org.uk\n \n",
