    "text": "60\n60\nChapter 2  Life-threatening emergencies\nCarotid artery\nSternomastoid\nmuscle\nFig. 2.8  Internal jugular cannulation.\nReproduced with permission from Rosen M et al. Handbook of  Percutaneous Central Venous \nCatheterisation. Copyright © Elsevier 1992.\nClavicle\nFirst rib\nSuperior vena cava\nFinger in\nsuprasternal\nnotch\nSubclavian vein\nFig. 2.9  Subclavian vein cannulation.\n",
