    "text": "  \nMyocardial infarction: ECG changes 1\n77\nElectrocardiogram changes following myocardial infarction\nElectrocardiograms after myocardial infarction\nNormal\nHours\nDays\nWeeks\nMonths\nFig. 3.5  Electrocardiogram changes following myocardial infarction.\nFig. 3.6  Acute inferolateral infarction with ‘reciprocal’ ST changes in I, aVL, and V2 to V3.\nFig. 3.7  Acute anteroseptal infarction with minimal ‘reciprocal’ ST changes in III and aVF.\n \n \n",
