    "text": "  \nSpontaneous pneumothorax\n121\nFig. 3.29  Management of pneumothorax.\nReproduced from MacDuff A, et al., Thorax 2010; 65(2):ii18eii31, copyright © 2010, with permission from BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.\n",
