    "text": "  \nHypothermia: presentation\n265\nNotes on the ECG shown in Fig. 6.1\n\t•\t Rhythm disturbance: AF with slow ventricular response.\n\t•\t Prolongation of QRS.\n\t•\t Delayed repolarization ‘J waves’ (arrowed).\n\t•\t ST–​T wave abnormalities.\nFig. 6.1  ECG in hypothermia.\n \n",
