    "text": "  \nNerve blocks at the ankle\n315\nNerve blocks at the ankle\nSural nerve\nMedial plantar nerve\nLateral plantar nerve\nLateral malleolus\nPosterior tibial artery\nMedial malleolus\nAchilles tendon\nTibial nerve\nSural nerve\nAchilles tendon\nFig. 7.7  Nerve blocks at the ankle.\n \n",
