    "text": "  \n329\nMaxillofacial injuries: introduction  378\nMiddle third facial fractures  380\nZygomatic, orbital, and frontal sinus fractures  382\nMajor bleeding after facial trauma  383\nMandibular fractures  384\nTemporomandibular joint dislocation  385\nPenetrating neck trauma  386\nSilver trauma  387\nApproach to possible spinal injury  388\nSpine and spinal cord injury  390\nSpine and spinal cord injury: imaging  392\nDermatomes  394\nGunshot injuries  396\nBlast injuries  397\nBurns: assessment  398\nMajor burns: resuscitation  400\nInhalation injury  402\nManagement of smaller burns  404\nCrush syndrome  406\n",
