    "text": "348\n348\nChapter 8  Major trauma\nFig. 8.7  CXR in a patient with blunt chest trauma.\nFig. 8.8  CT in the same patient shown in Fig. 8.7—​blunt chest trauma, comprising \nrib fractures, subcutaneous emphysema, a left pneumothorax, and a small \nhaemothorax.\n",
