    "text": "  \n409\nOther elbow injuries  465\nShaft of humerus fracture  465\nSoft tissue elbow/​arm problems  466\nAnterior shoulder dislocation  468\nPosterior shoulder dislocation  470\nClavicle and AC joint injuries  471\nHumeral neck/​head fracture  472\nOther shoulder injuries  473\nSoft tissue shoulder problems  474\nSoft tissue neck injuries  476\nFacial wounds  478\nPelvic fractures  480\nHip dislocations and acetabular fractures  482\nSacral and coccygeal fractures  483\nHip fractures  484\nShaft of femur fractures  486\nApproach to knee injuries  488\nPatella fracture  489\nDislocations of the patella and knee  490\nTibial plateau fracture  491\nSoft tissue knee injuries  492\nOther knee problems  493\nTibial and ﬁbular shaft fractures  494\nPretibial lacerations  495\nCalf and Achilles tendon injuries  496\nApproach to ankle injuries  498\nAnkle fractures and dislocations  500\nAnkle X-​rays  501\nAnkle sprains  502\nVenous thromboembolism prevention  503\nFoot fractures and dislocations  504\nToe injuries  506\nSoft tissue foot problems  507\nAtraumatic low back pain  508\nAcute arthritis  510 \nEponymous fractures  514\n",
