    "text": "  \nClinical signs of hand injury\n441\nFig. 9.12  Testing superﬁcial ﬂexor ﬁnger tendon.\nFig. 9.13  Testing deep ﬂexor ﬁnger tendon.\nMCPJ\nNormal\nSwan neck\nBoutonnière\nMallet\nPIPJ\nDIPJ\nFig. 9.14  Finger deformities.\n",
