    "text": "  \n519\nSurgery\nApproach to abdominal pain  520\nCauses of acute abdominal pain  522\nAcute appendicitis  523\nAcute pancreatitis  524\nBiliary tract problems  526\nPeptic ulcer disease  527\nMechanical intestinal obstruction  528\nParalytic intestinal obstruction  529\nMesenteric ischaemia/​infarction  530\nLarge bowel emergencies  532\nAnorectal problems  534\nRuptured abdominal aortic aneurysm  536\nAcute limb ischaemia  538\nComplications of varicose veins  539\nUreteric colic  540\nRetention of urine  542\nPenile problems and prostatitis  543\nTesticular problems  544\nCellulitis and erysipelas  545\nAbscesses  546\nComplications after surgery  548\nChapter 10\n \n",
