    "text": "  \n549\nOphthalmology\nApproach to eye problems  550\nBlunt eye injury  552\nPenetrating eye injury  553\nCorneal trauma  554\nContact lens problems  555\nSudden visual loss  556\nThe red eye  558\nPupillary abnormalities  560\nChapter 11\n \n",
