    "text": "  \n561\nEar, nose, and throat\nEar, nose, and throat foreign bodies  562\nFacial nerve palsy  564\nEar examination  565\nCochlear implants  565\nEarache  566\nEpistaxis  568\nNasal fracture  569\nSore throat  570\nVertigo  572\nSalivary gland problems  574\nDental anatomy  575\nDental emergencies  576\nChapter 12\n \n",
