    "text": "  \n579\nObstetrics and gynaecology\nGynaecological problems  580\nVaginal discharge  582\nContraceptive problems  584\nGenital injury, assault, and female genital mutilation  586\nGynaecological pain  588\nVaginal bleeding  590\nThe pregnant patient  592\nPrescribing in pregnancy  594\nHyperemesis gravidarum  595\nVaginal bleeding in pregnancy  596\nMiscarriage  598\nEctopic pregnancy  600\nVaginal bleeding in later pregnancy  602\nAbdominal pain in pregnancy  604\nMedical complications of pregnancy  606\nEmergency normal delivery  608\nObstetric emergencies  610\nTrauma in pregnancy  612\nCardiac arrest in pregnancy  614\nPost-​partum problems  616\nChapter 13\n \n",
