    "text": "  \n617\nPsychiatry\nApproach to psychiatric problems  618\nGlossary of psychiatric terms  619\nThe psychiatric interview  620\nMental state examination  622\nThe aggressive patient: background  624\nSafe consultations with potentially violent patients  625\nManaging aggression  626\nEmergency tranquillization  627\nSelf-​harm  628\nAssessment of suicide risk  630\nMental health assessment issues  631\nDepression  632\nMania  633\nSchizophrenia  634\nComplications of psychiatric drugs  635\nMunchausen’s syndrome  636\nMedically unexplained symptoms  637\nAlcohol abuse  638\nAcute alcohol intoxication  639\nAlcohol withdrawal  640\nAlcohol-​related brain injury  641\nHelp for alcoholics  641\nDrug and substance abuse  642\nCompulsory hospitalization  644\nMental Capacity Act  645\nChapter 14\n \n",
