    "text": "  \nResuscitation of the newborn\n659\nAT\nALL\nTIMES\nASK:\nDO\nYOU\nNEED\nHELP?\nFig. 15.2  Algorithm for newborn life support 2015.\nReproduced with the kind permission of the Resuscitation Council (UK), M www.resus.org.uk\n",
