    "text": "  \nPaediatric Basic Life Support\n663\nUnresponsive\nShout for help\nOpen airway\nNot breathing normally\nFive rescue breaths\nNo signs of life\n15 chest compressions\n2 rescue breaths\n15 chest compressions\nCall resuscitation team\n(1min CPR ﬁrst, if alone)\nFig. 15.5  Paediatric Basic Life Support 2015 (health care professionals with a duty \nto respond).\nReproduced with the kind permission of the Resuscitation Council (UK), M www.resus.org.uk\n",
