    "text": "  \nChoking from a foreign body\n665\nUnconscious \nOpen airway\nFive breaths\nStart CPR\nConscious \nFive back blows\nFive thrusts\n(chest for infant)\n(abdominal for\nchild >1y)\nEncourage cough \nContinue to check for\ndeterioration to ineﬀective\ncough or until obstruction\nrelieved\nEﬀective cough \nIneﬀective cough \nAssess severity \nFig. 15.6  Paediatric foreign body airway obstruction treatment 2015.\nReproduced with the kind permission of the Resuscitation Council (UK), M www.resus.org.uk\n",
