    "text": "  \nMeningococcal disease\n685\nFig. 15.11  Management of meningococcal disease in children and young people. Take blood for glucose, FBC, coagulation screen, U&E, Ca2+, Mg2+, PO4\n3–​, \nblood cultures, ABG, lactate, cross-​match, and PCR for Neisseria meningitidis.\nReproduced with kind permission from the Meningitis Research Foundation M www.meningitis.org\n",
    "metadata": {
