    "text": "  \nSevere acute asthma in children\n697\nFig. 15.16  Management of acute asthma in children aged >5y (see: M https://​\nwww.brit-​thoracic.org.uk and M https://​www.sign.ac.uk).\nThis figure is reproduced from SIGN 158: British guideline on the management of  asthma, by kind \npermission of the Scottish Intercollegiate Guidelines Network.\n",
