    "text": "  \nPaediatric fractures and dislocations\n743\nNormal\nType I\nType II\nType III\nType IV\nType V\nFig. 15.23  Salter–​Harris classiﬁcation of epiphyseal injuries.\nFig. 15.24  Salter–​Harris II fracture of the distal \nradius in an 11y old.\nFig. 15.26  Salter–​Harris IV \nfracture of the distal tibia in \na 15y old.\nFig. 15.25  Salter–​Harris III fracture of the proximal phalanx of the big toe in a 14y old.\n",
