    "text": "01 0:2 03 04 05 06\nseconds (50 mm/sec)\n\n01\n\n{\n\nECG measurements\n\n400 300200 150 10090 80 70\n\nqn 0\n\nRead 2 cycles from arrow\n(paper speed 25 mm/sec)\n\nInterval ST\nInterval\n\n1\n‘\n'\n'\n1\n1\n\nComplex {¢«——___—_—__»'\nQT Interval\n\nStandard\nTimes\n(secs)\n\nInterval\n\nPR | 0.12-0.22\nST | 0.27-0.33\nQT | 0.35-0.42\nQRS | 0.08-0.11\n\n(das/ww gz) spuosas\ntl O41 80 9:0 #0 2-0\n\nLrvvluvelivctoisivli\n",
