    "text": "Cochrane\nLibrary\nTrusted evidence.\nInformed decisions.\nBetter health.\n \n \nCochrane Database of Systematic Reviews\n \nFigure 1.   Flow diagram of the studies identified by the search strategy. *The ongoing studies will be reassessed in\nthe next version of this review.\n631 records \nidentified through \ndatabase searching\n631 records after \nduplicates removed\n631 records \nscreened\n456 records \nexcluded: \n- 3 not randomised\n- 453 wrong \nintervention\n175 full-text \narticles assessed \nfor eligibility\n3 full-text articles \nexcluded: wrong \npopulation (3)\n9 ongoing studies*\n42 studies (163 \nreports, 48,148 \nparticipants) \nincluded in \nqualitative \nsynthesis\n27 studies (37,820 \nparticipants) \nincluded in \nquantitative \nsynthesis \n(meta-analysis)\nGlucagon-like peptide 1 (GLP-1) receptor agonists for people with chronic kidney disease and diabetes (Review)\nCopyright © 2025 The Cochrane Collaboration. Published by John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.\n11\n",
