    }
  },
  {
    "text": "5)\n\nSuperticial spreading melanoma\n\nNodular melanoma\n\nOther suspicious lesions\n\na)\nb)\nc)\nqd)\ne)\n\nf)\n\n9)\n\nInfected/Traumatised benign lesions\nPyogenic granuloma\n\nKaposi sarcoma (haemangiosarcoma)\nLymphoma of skin (mycosis fungoides)\nDermatofibrosarcoma protuberans\n\nCancer — metastatic skin deposits, acanthosis nigricans\n(paraneoplastic skin reaction)\n\nMerkel cell tumour (rare malignancy from sensory dermal cells)\n\n397\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "AMC Anthology of Medical Conditions.pdf",
