  {
    "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nNail sign\nSome causes\nPage\nno.\nBlue nails\nCyanosis, Wilson’s disease,\nochronosis\n25\nRed nails\nPolycythaemia (reddish-blue),\ncarbon monoxide poisoning (cherry-\nred)\n236\nYellow nails\nYellow nail syndrome\n132\nLung cancer, chronic pulmonary\nsuppuration, infective endocarditis,\n",
