    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Table 4.4b Differential diagnosis of chest pain\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nFavours myocardial infarction (acute\ncoronary syndrome)\nFavours\nangina\nOnset at rest\nOnset with\nexertion\nMay be severe\nLess severe\nSweating\nNo sweating\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Clinical Examination-Talley & Connor-pdf.pdf",
