    "text": " \nThe filling of the right side of the heart from the systemic veins can be\nassessed by inspection of the jugular veins in the neck (Figure 4.5) and by\npalpation of the liver. These veins empty into the right atrium.\nFigure 4 5 The jugular venous pressure (JVP) (a) Assessment of the JVP The patient\n",
