    }
  },
  {
    "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nBradycardia\n \nRegular rhythm\nIrregular rhythm\nPhysiological (athletes, during\nsleep: due to increased vagal\ntone)\nIrregularly irregular\nD\n(\nb t bl\nk\nAtrial fibrillation (in combination\nwith conduction system disease or\nAV nodal blocking drugs) due to:\n",
