    "text": "Softer with isometric handgrip—\nhypertrophic cardiomyopathy\n3.6\n0.1\nLouder with isometric handgrip—mitral\nregurgitation\n5.8\n0.3\n \nFrom McGee S, Evidence-based physical diagnosis, 2nd edn. St Louis: Saunders, 2007.\nTABLE 4.16 Dynamic manoeuvres and systolic cardiac murmurs\n \n \nFigure 4.33 Dynamic auscultation for aortic regurgitation or a pericardial friction rub;\n",
