  {
    "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nSign\nPositive\nLR\nNegative\nLR\nSores or ulcers on feet\n7.0\nNS\nFeet pale, red or blue\n2.8\n0.7\nAtrophic skin\n1.7\nNS\nAbsent hair\n1.7\nNS\nOne foot cooler\n6.1\n0.9\nAbsent femoral pulse\n6.1\nNS\nAbsent dorsalis pedis and posterior tibial\npulses\n14.9\n0.3\nLimb bruit present\n7.3\n0.7\nCapillary refill time >5 seconds\n1.9\nNS\nCapillary refill >20 seconds\n3.6\nNS\n \nNS = not significant.\n \nFrom McGee S, Evidence-based physical diagnosis, 2nd edn. St Louis: Saunders, 2007.\n",
