  {
    "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nGeneral signs\nPositive\nLR\nNegative\nLR\nHeart rate >100 beats per minute at rest\n5.5\nNS\nValsalva manoeuvre abnormal\n7.6\n0.1\nLungs\n \n \nCrackles\nNS\nNS\nCardiac examination\n \n \nJVP elevated\n3.9\nNS\nAbdominojugular test positive\n8.0\n0.3\nApex displaced lateral to midclavicular\nline\n5.8\nNS\nS3\n5 7\nNS\n",
