    }
  },
  {
    "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nSign\nPositive LR Negative LR\nGeneral appearance\n \n \nCachexia\n4.0\nNS\nAbnormal mental state\n2.2\nNS\nVital signs\n \n \nTemperature >37.8°C\n2.2\n0.7\nR\ni\n28/ i\n2 2\n0 8\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Clinical Examination-Talley & Connor-pdf.pdf",
      "page": 314,
