    "text": "g y)\n3 Known clotting-factor abnormalities\n4 Known malignancy\n \nNote: A firm diagnosis cannot be made on the symptoms and signs\nalone.\nThe chest X-ray\n \nThe radiological appearance of a normal lung, with the lung segments\nlabelled, is shown in Figure 5.15.\nFigure 5.15 Lung segments\n( ) P\ni\ni\n(b) CT\nh\nh l\nb\n( ) L f l\nl i\n(d) Ri h\n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Clinical Examination-Talley & Connor-pdf.pdf",
