    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Figure 6.4 (right) Dermatitis herpetiformis\nFrom McDonald FS, ed., Mayo Clinic images in internal medicine, with permission. © Mayo Clinic Scientific Press\nand CRC Press.\n \n",
