    "text": "dayss o e day?\n15. Are you taking medications to help the kidney function?\n16. What tablets and medications (including over-the-counter products, herbal remedies,\netc.) are you taking?\n \nTable 7.2 The major renal syndromes\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nName\nDefinition\nExample\nNephrotic\nMassive\nproteinuria\nMinimal change disease\nNephritic\nHaematuria, renal\nfailure\nPost-streptococcal\nglomerulonephritis\nTubulointerstitial\nnephropathy\nRenal failure, mild\nproteinuria\nAnalgesic nephropathy\nAcute renal\nfailure*\nSudden fall in\nfunction, rise in\nAcute tubular necrosis\n",
