    "text": "Figure 7.1 The anatomy of the kidneys and urinary tract\n \nFigure 7.2 CT angiogram showing the origins and course of the renal arteries (large\narrows) from the abdominal aorta; the left and right inferior phrenic arteries are visible arising\nsuperiorly\n \n",
