    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Ductus vos) ~ Tal of\ndeferens epididymis\n\nFigure 7.9 Basic male reproductive anatomy\n\n(a) To palpate the epididymis, feel along the posterior pole\nof the testis\n\n(b) Scrotal swelling-fingers can ‘get above’ mass\n\n",
