      "year": "2020",
      "edition": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Figure 8.18 Postsplenectomy picture\nFilm shows several Howell-Jolly bodies, target cells and crenated cells.\n \nFigure 8.19 Malaria\nThe two red cells in the centre show the trophozoite.\n \n",
