      "word_count": 108,
      "title": "Talley & Connor's Clinical Examination",
      "author": "Talley & Connor",
      "year": "2020",
      "edition": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "Figure 11.96 Anatomy and vascular supply of the spinal cord\nNote: Anterior spinal artery occlusion spares posterior column function.\n \nFigure 11.97 Spinal cord syndromes\nAdapted from Brazis PW, Localisation in clinical neurology, Philadelphia: Lippincott, Williams & Wilkins, 2001.\n \n",
