  },
  {
    "text": "Figure 11.100 Conus medullaris or cauda equina lesion—saddle anaesthesia\n \nTABLE 11.30 Important motor and reflex changes of spinal cord compression\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Clinical Examination-Talley & Connor-pdf.pdf",
      "page": 901,
