    "text": "p\nHead injury\nSubdural haemorrhage\nCerebral contusion\nConcussion\nNutritional and vitamin\ndeficiency\nThiamine (Wernicke’\nencephalopathy)\nVitamin B12\nNicotinic acid\nEpilepsy\nStatus epilepticus\nPost-ictal states\n \nTABLE 12.9 Common causes of dementia\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "Clinical Examination-Talley & Connor-pdf.pdf",
      "page": 980,
