    "text": "Figure 13.7 Herpes zoster, involving the eye, along the distribution of the ophthalmic\nbranch of the fifth cranial nerve\nFrom Mir MA, Atlas of Clinical Diagnosis, 2nd edn. Edinburgh: Saunders, 2003, with permission.\n \nFigure 13.8 A chalazion; unlike styes, chalazions are not usually tender or painful.\n \nThe ears\n \nExamination anatomy\n",
