    "text": "c ease t e\ne\nood o t e p ese ce o bacte ae\na (Good signs guide\n16.1).\nGOOD SIGNS GUIDE 16.1 Clinical findings and bacteraemia\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n",
