    "text": " \n5. Language \n(a) Ask the patient to name the following as you point: 'pen'.... 'watch                                      /2 \n(b) Have the patient repeat: 'No its. ands, or buts                                                                /1 \n(c) \nHave the patient follow a three stage command: \n1 Take this paper in your right hand. Fold the paper in half.                                          /3 \nPut the paper down in your lap'. \n(d) Have the patient read and obey the following: CLOSE YOUR EYES \n/1 \n(e) Have the patient write a sentence (containing subject, verb, object) \n/1 \n6. Construction \nAsk the patient to copy this design \n \n/1 \n \n \nScore = /30 \n445 \n",
