    "text": " \n14  •  Headache\n141\nFigure 14–3  A, Brudzinski's sign. The test result is positive \nwhen the patient actively flexes his or her hips and knees in \nresponse to passive neck flexion by the examiner. B, Kernig's \nsign. The test result is positive when pain or resistance is elic-\nited by passive knee extension from the 90-degree hip-knee \nflexion position.\n",
