    "text": "Patient-Related Problems: The Common Calls\n156\nFigure 15–8  Electrocardiographic tracing of rapid regular \nrhythm: sinus tachycardia.\nFigure 15–9  Electrocardiographic tracing of rapid regular \nrhythm: atrial flutter.\nFigure 15–10  Electrocardiographic tracing of rapid regular \nrhythm: supraventricular tachycardia, ectopic atrial tachycardia.\nFigure 15–7  Electrocardiographic tracing of rapid irregu-\nlar rhythm: sinus tachycardia with premature ventricular \ncontractions.\n",
