  {
    "text": "Patient-Related Problems: The Common Calls\n228\nMajor threat to life\t\n• Failure of delivery of medications\nInterruption of the delivery of essential medications may \ntemporarily deprive the patient of required treatment.\nFigure 20–1  Causes of blocked central lines. A, Kinked tubing. \nB, Thrombosis at the catheter tip.\n",
