    "text": "Contents\t\nxvii\nPelvic examination\t\n752\nRectal examination\t\n762\nOSCE revision topics – the gynaecological  \nhistory and examination\t\n762\nT&O’C essentials\t\n762\nReferences\t\n762\nCHAPTER 41\nThe breasts: history and  \nexamination\t\n763\nExamination anatomy\t\n763\nHistory\t\n763\nExamination\t\n764\nInspection\t\n764\nPalpation\t\n765\nEvaluation of a breast lump\t\n766\nT&O’C essentials\t\n766\nOSCE revision topics – the breasts\t\n767\nReferences\t\n767\nSECTION 12\nSPECIALTY SYSTEM HISTORY AND \nEXAMINATION\t\n769\nCHAPTER 42\nThe eyes, ears, nose and  \nthroat\t\n771\nEyes\t\n771\nExamination anatomy\t\n771\nHistory\t\n772\nExamination method\t\n772\nT&O’C essentials\t\n775\nT&O’C essentials\t\n776\nDiplopia\t\n778\nHorner’s syndrome\t\n778\nIritis\t\n780\nGlaucoma\t\n780\nShingles\t\n781\nEyelid\t\n781\nEars\t\n782\nExamination anatomy\t\n782\nHistory\t\n783\nExamination method\t\n785\nT&O’C essentials\t\n788\nNose and sinuses\t\n788\nExamination anatomy\t\n788\nHistory\t\n789\nExamination method\t\n790\nSinusitis\t\n790\nMouth and throat\t\n791\nExamination anatomy\t\n791\nHistory\t\n792\nExamination method\t\n792\nPharyngitis\t\n794\nSupraglottitis (epiglottitis)\t\n795\nCommon investigations\t\n795\nT&O’C essentials\t\n796\nOSCE examples\t\n797\nOSCE revision topics – eyes, ears, nose  \nand throat\t\n798\nReferences\t\n798\nCHAPTER 43\nThe skin and lumps\t\n799\nExamination anatomy\t\n799\nDermatological history\t\n800\nGeneral principles of physical examination  \nof the skin\t\n801\nHow to approach the clinical diagnosis of  \na lump\t\n804\nCorrelation of physical signs and skin  \ndisease\t\n806\nPruritus\t\n806\nErythrosquamous eruptions\t\n807\nBlistering eruptions\t\n809\nErythroderma\t\n813\nLivedo reticularis\t\n814\nPustular and crusted lesions\t\n814\nDermal plaques\t\n815\nErythema nodosum\t\n816\nErythema multiforme (EM)\t\n816\nCellulitis and erysipelas\t\n817\nFolliculitis, furuncles and carbuncles\t\n818\nOther infections\t\n818\nHyperpigmentation, hypopigmentation  \nand depigmentation\t\n819\nFlushing and sweating\t\n819\nSkin tumours\t\n821\nThe nails\t\n823\nT&O’C essentials\t\n824\nOSCE example – skin\t\n825\nReferences\t\n825\nCHAPTER 44\nThe older person assessment\t\n826\nHistory taking in older persons:  \nspecial considerations\t\n826\nPhysical examination in older persons:  \nspecial considerations\t\n830\nDementia screening\t\n833\nOSCE revision topics – assessment of the  \ngeriatric patient\t\n833\nReferences\t\n833\n",
