    "text": "110\t\nSECTION 2  The cardiovascular system\n\t\nExternal jugular vein\nInternal jugular vein\nInferior thyroid vein\nPulmonary veins\nAbdominal vena cava\nTesticular vein\nCommon iliac vein\nExternal iliac vein\nInternal iliac vein\nDeep femoral vein\nExternal pudendal vein\nFemoral vein\nPopliteal vein\nGreat saphenous vein\nSmall saphenous vein\nAnterior/posterior\ntibial veins\nDeep plantar vein\nDorsal venous arch\nDorsal digital vein\nGreat saphenous vein\nSubclavian vein\nAxillary vein\nCephalic vein\nInternal thoracic vein\nBrachial veins\nBasilic vein\nSuperficial palmar arch\nIntercostal veins\nMedian cubital vein\nCephalic vein\nUlnar vein\nInferior epigastric vein\nDeep palmar arch\nThoracoepigastric vein\nInferior vena cava\nHepatic veins\nRenal veins\nHeart\n The venous system\nFIGURE 6.1\n",
