    "text": "132\t\nSECTION 2  The cardiovascular system\n\t\nValve cusps often\nthickened and calcified\nLeft ventricle may be\nhypertrophied\nAscending aorta may\nbe dilated\nb\nSystole\nDiastole\nS1\nA2\nP2\nS1\nEjection click\n(Suggests congenital AS)\nNormal\nMild\nS1\nS1\nModerate\nS1\nP2\nA2\nS1\nSevere\nReversed\nS2\nSingle\n(S2)\na\nFIGURE 7.9 \n(a) Murmur, at the aortic area; (b) anatomy \nAortic stenosis (AS). \n",
