    "text": "\tCHAPTER 12  A summary of the respiratory examination and extending the respiratory examination\t\n207\nFIGURE 12.6 \nd\nc\nb\na\n(a) Posteroanterior view. (b) CT scan through lung bases. (c) Left lateral view. \n(d) Right lateral view. \nRight upper lobe: ä = apical segment; a = anterior segment, p = posterior segment. \nLeft upper lobe: ä – p = apicoposterior segment, s = anterior segment, sl = superior lingular \nsegment, il = inferior lingular segment. \nRight middle lobe (rml): m = medial segment, l = lateral segment. \nRight lower lobe: äl = apical segment, mb = medial basal segment, lb = lateral basal segment, \nab = anterior basal segment, pb = posterior basal segment. \nLeft lower lobe: äl = apical segment, lb = lateral basal segment, ab = anterior basal segment, \npb = posterior basal segment \nLung segments. \n",
