    "text": "292\t\nSECTION 4  The gastrointestinal system\nMultiple echogenic round lesions are demonstrated in the liver from metastatic colon \ncarcinoma. Note also that the liver margin is lobulated owing to macronodular cirrhosis \n(From Jarnagin WR. Blumgart’s surgery of the liver, biliary tract and pancreas. Philadelphia: Elsevier, 2012.)\nFIGURE 16.10 \nUltrasound of liver metastasis. \n",
