    "text": "\t\nCHAPTER 22  A SUMMARY OF THE HAEMATOLOGICAL EXAMINATION\t\n359\nd\nc\nb\na\nFIGURE 22.17 \nCT scans of the chest revealing extensive lymphadenopathy, typical of a lymphoma. There \nare numerous lymph nodes in the anterior mediastinum displacing the thymus. \n(From Schaaf HS, Zumla A. Tuberculosis, 1st edn. Edinburgh: Saunders, 2009.)\n",
