    "text": "382\t\nSECTION 7  The rheumatological system\nb\na\n(a) Flexion—‘Make a fist’; (b) extension—\n‘Now open your hand up’ \nFIGURE 24.13 \nScreening metacarpophalangeal and \ninterphalangeal movements. \nb\na\n(a) Flexor profundus; (b) flexor superficialis \nFIGURE 24.14 \nTesting the superficial and profundus \nflexor tendons. \nThe key grip \nFIGURE 24.15 \nTesting opposition strength \nFIGURE 24.16 \n",
