    "text": "578\t\nSECTION 9  The nervous system\nb\na\n(a) Foot drop: the patient lifts the affected leg high in the air to prevent the foot scraping on \nthe ground. (b) Shoe supports to prevent foot drop \nFIGURE 34.53 \nCerebellar testing—heel–toe walking \nFIGURE 34.54 \nRomberg test. \nb\na\n(a) ‘Stand with your feet together.’ (b) ‘Now \nshut your eyes. I won’t let you fall.’ \nFIGURE 34.55 \n",
