    "text": "C H A P T E R  3 7\nThe paediatric history and examination\nJoerg Mattes and Bryony Ross\nC H A P T E R  3 8\nThe neonatal history and examination\nJoerg Mattes and Bryony Ross\nSECTION 10\nPaediatric and neonatal history \nand examination \n",
