    "text": "746\t\nSECTION 11  Women’s health history and examination\n\t\na\nb\nc\nd\ne\nf\n(a) MRI image of uterine fibroids; (b) angiography of fibroid before embolisation and (c) after \nembolisation; (d) pedunculated subserous fibroid; (e) intramural fibroid; (f) angiography of \nfibroid before embolisation \n(From Butori N. SSFSE sequence functional MRI of the human cervical spinal cord with complex finger tapping. Eur J Radiol 2009; 79(1):1–6.)\nFIGURE 40.1 \nUterine fibroids. \n",
