    "text": "808\t\nSECTION 12  SPECIALTY SYSTEM HISTORY AND EXAMINATION\nSolid, red\nnon-scaling\nDome\nshaped\nRed \npapules\ne.g. cherry\nangiomas\nRed \nnodules\ne.g. \nfuruncles\nTransient\nerythemas\ne.g.\nurticaria\nPersistent\nerythemas\ne.g.\nerythema\nnodosum,\nerythema\nmultiforme\nProminent\nplaque\ne.g.\npsoriasis,\ntinea\nNon-confluent\npapules\ne.g.\npityriasis\nrosea, lichen\nplanus\nExcoriations\nprominent\ne.g. atopic\ndermatitis,\nscabies\nLittle\nexcoriation\ne.g.\nseborrhoeic\ndermatitis,\nallergic\ncontact\ndermatitis\nPatches and\nplaques\ne.g. vitiligo\nMacules,\npapules or\nnodules\ne.g.\nmelanoma,\ndermato-\nfibroma,\nseborrhoeic\nkeratoses\nPatches\nand\nplaques\ne.g. café-\nau-lait\npatches\nHyper-\npigmentation\nPapules\ne.g.\nmolluscum\ncontagiosum\nFlat\ntopped\nNo\nepithelial\ndisruption\nEpithelial\ndisruption\nSkin\ncoloured\ne.g. warts,\nskin cancer,\nlipoma,\nsebaceous\ncyst\nSmooth\ne.g.\nxanthel-\nasma,\nnecro-\nbiosis\nlipoidica\nClear\ne.g.\npemphigus,\npemphigoid,\nStevens-\nJohnson,\nherpes\nsimplex,\nvaricella\nzoster,\ndermatitis\nherpeti-\nformis\nPustular\ne.g.\nacne\nvulgaris,\nacne\nrosacea\nRough\ne.g. any\ncrusted\nlesion\nWhite\nYellow\nBrown–\nblack\nInspection and palpation\nSolid, red\nscaling\nSolid,\nnot red\nFluid-\nfilled\nDiagnosis of skin disease: an algorithm \n(Adapted from Lynch PJ. Dermatology for the house officer, 2nd edn. Baltimore: Williams & Wilkins, 1987.)\nFIGURE 43.9 \n",
