    "text": "SECTION 15\nAdult history taking and examination \nin the wards and clinics\nC H A P T E R  5 0\nWriting and presenting the adult history and \nphysical examination\nC H A P T E R  5 1\nA suggested method for a rapid screening adult \nphysical examination\n",
