tio\nwide pulse pressure, 634–635\nWIPER, 38b\nWorld Health Organization (WHO), \nguidelines, in hand washing, 38–39\nwrist\nextension, 380, 380f\nflexion, 380, 380f\nlesion at (carpal tunnel), 559\npower testing of, 552–553, 553f\ntenosynovitis of, 423–424\nwriting, 599, 600t\nX\nx descent, 90–91\nxanthelasmata, 89, 89f, 239\nxanthomata, in Achilles tendon, 113\nX-ray\nabdominal, 285–287, 286t\nof alveolar pulmonary oedema, 152f\nof ankylosing spondylitis, 432f\nof aortic coarctation, 153f\nof arthritis, 430\nof ASD, 153f\nchest\nchecklist of, 206–210\nin respiratory examination, 206\nof gout, 434f\nof interstitial pulmonary oedema, 151f\nof Marfan’s syndrome, 154f\nof mitral valve disease, 152f\nof osteoarthritis, 430f\nof osteoporosis, 485f\nof psoriatic arthritis, 433f\nof pulmonary venous congestion, \n151f\nof rheumatoid arthritis, 431f, 433f\nof ventricular aneurysm, 152f\nsee also chest X-ray\nY\nyellow nail syndrome, 193, 193f\nZ\nZ deformity, 375–376, 377f\nzosteriform rash, 806f\n",
